[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_02_0010","text":"嗯～……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_02_0020","text":"怎么了小糸"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_02_0030","text":"嗯～～\n自拍，怎么都拍不好啊～～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_02_0040","text":"原来如此……？\n如果你不是非要自拍的话，我来帮你拍怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_02_0050","text":"！\n可以吗～！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_02_0060","text":"可以可以～\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_02_0070","text":"好开心～\n结华拍照很厉害，一定能拍出好照片的～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_02_0080","text":"嗯呵呵，那我可得认真拍了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_02_0090","text":"就拜托你啦，结华摄影师！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_02_0100","text":"好——，交给我吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_02_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_02_0003","text":"Motion"}]
